    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d474-a8">

                <pb facs="0588" n="480" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg480"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 8 in No. 10.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Esselstyn to Mr.
                            Tyler.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran, Persia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-01-14"><hi rendition="#italic">January 14,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Tyler</hi>: Please say to Mr. Sperry that I
                    have received his inclosure. As you request, I hand you herewith twenty krans,
                    anams (presents), for the policemen.</p>
                <p>Will you kindly thank Mr. Sperry and yourself for your prompt action in the
                    matter of the insults offered to Mrs. Esselstyn by Ali Akbar Khan.</p>
                <p>Yours, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lewis F.
                    Esselstyn.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
